DATA ATTRIBUTION

This project consumes, but does not redistribute, live data from:

  - Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com/), forecast and historical (ERA5
    reanalysis) endpoints, licensed CC BY 4.0.
  - The GBIF Backbone Taxonomy (https://www.gbif.org/), queried for plant
    taxonomy.

Care ranges in src/lib/species.ts are approximate published horticultural
guidelines compiled for this project. They are provided as-is, are not a
measure of any specific cultivar, and must not be treated as veterinary,
horticultural or medical advice.